{
  "format": 1,
  "about": "Banana's own expressions (sidekick, PLAN block #50). Offsets added to the pose the motion owner composes, so the gaze is kept. yaw / pitch / roll in degrees (positive yaw turns left, positive pitch looks down, positive roll tilts toward the right shoulder), x / y / z in mm (forward, left, up), ant / ant_r / ant_l in degrees: positive swings an antenna outward — about +30 is perked (listening), +70 to +100 flung or flattened, +110 and more hanging down at the side (droop); negative would cross it inward and is not used. keys: [t, value] pairs, monotone cubic. osc: enveloped sines (ant_alt drives the antennas in opposition). kind: beat (conversation, ≤ 2 s), emotion (a real feeling, ≤ 3 s), performance (long, never mid-reply), state (thinking; loop_from / then).",
